	Multi Tool - loader-style GUI
	Features: Fly Mode, Magnet + Formation, Player ESP

	Usage:
		loadstring(game:HttpGet("URL", true))()

	Notes:
	- Parts only follow the magnet if your client has network ownership of them
	  (the script raises your simulation radius where the executor allows it).
	- Roblox renders at most ~31 Highlights at once, so ESP is capped by the engine.
]]

